# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NEVER commit anything from the owner's security preset. Its persona, its
# authorization registry and its allowlists are private property: the registry
# alone names every client and every authorized target. The Node ports of its
# tools live next to this checkout instead, and reach the device over USB.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
preset-security/
**/.agent-presets/
**/authorization*.md
**/infra-allowlist.txt
**/persona*.md
*.credentials.yaml
.env

# Same shapes as scripts/privacy-guard.sh, so a local slip cannot even be staged.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
